# Working notes and scratch docs are personal, not project documentation.
# Everything directly under docs/ is ignored; the project documents below are
# re-included explicitly. Add a new project doc here to track it — otherwise it
# stays local, which is the point.
docs/*
!docs/execution_plan.md
!docs/sanity_setup_deviations.md
!docs/hero-brushstrokes.md
!docs/superpowers/

# Local working copy of docs/. Kept deliberately; never tracked.
.docs/

# Windows alternate-data-stream markers left by copying through Explorer
*:Zone.Identifier
